      "id": 108714,
      "message": "Thousands of videos filmed in Iran during the protests earlier this year reached Iranian broadcaster \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/manotoofficial\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e@manotoofficial\u003c/a\u003e - a rare record of both violence and resilience as the regime tried to stop any information leaving the country. Manoto and its founder kayvan.abbassi produced \u0026#39;THIS IS OUR STORY\u0026#39; to document one of the most traumatic chapters in Iran’s history, ensuring the stories of those who lived through it, and those who died, are never forgotten. Part 2 of Deep Dive: Inside Iran’s Bloodiest Crackdown. \u003ca href=\"?q=%23deepdive\"\u003e#deepdive\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"?q=%23news\"\u003e#news\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"?q=%23iran\"\u003e#iran\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"?q=%23protest\"\u003e#protest\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"?q=%23manoto\"\u003e#manoto\u003c/a\u003e",
